{"embedding_dim": 512, "data": [{"__id__": "ent-a153adcfa90258ae97e73d8c8a4ab480", "__created_at__": 1789553461, "__write_seq__": 1789553461140946000, "content": "陈宇\n陈宇是支付结果查询接口开发任务的负责人。", "entity_name": "陈宇", "source_id": "chunk-89af6ea526853b5d542603c166004337", "file_path": "chunk-17.md", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "ent-2a32dabcb2c70010f0f4d565ea33c4a6", "__created_at__": 1789553461, "__write_seq__": 1789553461140946000, "content": "支付结果查询接口开发\n支付结果查询接口开发任务由陈宇负责，9 月 15 日已交付。", "entity_name": "支付结果查询接口开发", "source_id": "chunk-89af6ea526853b5d542603c166004337", "file_path": "chunk-17.md", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "ent-baac939ba21de57fba7ad8a09354cea4", "__created_at__": 1789553461, "__write_seq__": 1789553461140946000, "content": "支付结果查询接口\n按照支付流水号返回处理中、成功或失败；回调改造用它主动查询支付结果。", "entity_name": "支付结果查询接口", "source_id": "chunk-dea59eb8420a967ce699d3de08b0c0cd", "file_path": "chunk-03.md", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "ent-15095d14367f7f02655030d498a4ba03", "__created_at__": 1789553461, "__write_seq__": 1789553461140946000, "content": "李明\n李明是支付回调改造任务的负责人。", "entity_name": "李明", "source_id": "chunk-6bdcfd4ae28959019954678df0a4a519", "file_path": "chunk-18.md", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "ent-255fe37fabaccce2c46923f561f1f3f8", "__created_at__": 1789553461, "__write_seq__": 1789553461140946000, "content": "支付回调改造\n支付回调改造包含主动查询补偿和重复回调去重，截至 9 月 16 日处于联调中。", "entity_name": "支付回调改造", "source_id": "chunk-6bdcfd4ae28959019954678df0a4a519", "file_path": "chunk-18.md", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "ent-a4a6de3d61db840fee06b30d79b22731", "__created_at__": 1789553461, "__write_seq__": 1789553461140946000, "content": "王蕾\n王蕾负责组织支付联调验收。", "entity_name": "王蕾", "source_id": "chunk-34c7ed20deaba292969335ba306765fd", "file_path": "chunk-19.md", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "ent-460d7b1f8934bd41153b4590d1e864ad", "__created_at__": 1789553461, "__write_seq__": 1789553461140946000, "content": "支付联调验收\n支付联调验收依赖查询接口和回调改造完成，截至 9 月 16 日待开始。", "entity_name": "支付联调验收", "source_id": "chunk-34c7ed20deaba292969335ba306765fd", "file_path": "chunk-19.md", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "ent-078122a82270f4d3f3456108ed141c03", "__created_at__": 1789553461, "__write_seq__": 1789553461140946000, "content": "支付联调验收规范\n支付联调验收规范描述回调丢失、重复回调、查询超时用例。", "entity_name": "支付联调验收规范", "source_id": "chunk-0b6b67eb16ce0cf8d7aa7add51fa757a", "file_path": "chunk-11.md", "vector": ""}, {"__id__": "ent-91ef6cdced1796442d8de89fdb7fc0bb", "__created_at__": 1789553461, "__write_seq__": 1789553461140946000, "content": "接口查询约定\n接口查询约定说明查询状态的含义，以及重复查询和重复回调不得重复发货。", "entity_name": "接口查询约定", "source_id": "chunk-dea59eb8420a967ce699d3de08b0c0cd", "file_path": "chunk-03.md", "vector": ""}], "matrix": ""}